# Festag Night — dark mode tokens

Canonical source: `lib/design-tokens/dark.ts` → `app/globals.css` `[data-theme="dark"]`.

Deep zinc OLED — serious, not washed blue-slate. Accent `#5B647D` for focus/links.
Auth ready CTA = warm bone `#EBE8E3`. Auth Google is a quiet ghost (not filled blue).

## Ladder

| Layer | Token | Value |
|---|---|---|
| Canvas | `--festag-black-canvas` | `#070708` |
| Content | `--festag-black-content` | `#0E0E10` |
| Raised | `--festag-black-raised` | `#151518` |
| Popup | `--festag-black-popup` | `#1A1A1E` |
| Peak | `--festag-black-peak` | `#212126` |
| Hover | `--hover` | `#27272C` |
| Ink | `--festag-night-ink` | `#E6E6EA` |
| Primary accent | `--festag-primary` | `#5B647D` |
| Ready CTA (auth) | `--festag-btn-ready-bg` | `#EBE8E3` / fg `#1A1917` |

## Rules

1. Prefer tokens over hardcoded blacks.
2. Soft ink — not pure white body text.
3. Auth idle CTAs stay transparent ghosts; ready = warm bone.
4. Quiet hairlines (~6–10% white).
5. Brand marks muted at idle (~40% opacity) on auth.

## Do not

- Washed blue-slate canvases (`#0B0C10` era)
- Bright white idle Google/Apple icons on auth
- Colored Google fills on auth SSO
